          "1. At startup of given size or material, then once every two hours for each extruder (winding or casting machines for FRP).",
          "2. At startup of a given size, machine or material then once per 24 hours for each material in a plant. If one material is continuously used in several machines or sizes, then sample selection shall be from a different machine each day, and rotated in sequence among all sizes or machines.",
